sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User Browser
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant OAuthProxy as OAuth Proxy Sidecar<br/>(Injected by Controller)
    participant Jupyter as Jupyter Server<br/>8888/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server<br/>Configurable
    participant Git as Git Remote<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over User,Git: Flow 1: User Notebook Session

    User->>Route: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS 1.2+
    Route->>OAuthProxy: Forward request<br/>Edge TLS termination
    OAuthProxy->>OAuthProxy: Validate OpenShift OAuth token
    OAuthProxy->>Jupyter: HTTP/8888<br/>Jupyter token<br/>(localhost)
    Jupyter-->>OAuthProxy: JupyterLab UI / API response
    OAuthProxy-->>Route: Response
    Route-->>User: HTTPS response

    Note over Jupyter,S3: Notebook Runtime Operations

    Jupyter->>K8sAPI: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Jupyter: K8s resources

    Jupyter->>S3: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS 1.2+<br/>AWS IAM / HMAC
    S3-->>Jupyter: Datasets / artifacts

    Jupyter->>HF: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS 1.2+<br/>API token
    HF-->>Jupyter: Models / datasets

    Jupyter->>MLflow: HTTP(S)<br/>Configurable
    MLflow-->>Jupyter: Experiment data

    Jupyter->>Git: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS 1.2+<br/>Token/SSH
    Git-->>Jupyter: Repository data

    Note over User,Git: Flow 2: Pipeline Runtime Execution

    participant DSP as Data Science Pipelines
    participant Runtime as Runtime Container<br/>(Headless Python)

    DSP->>Runtime: Pod execution<br/>(no network call)
    Runtime->>S3: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS 1.2+<br/>AWS credentials
    S3-->>Runtime: Pipeline artifacts
    Runtime->>K8sAPI: HTTPS/443<br/>TLS 1.2+<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Runtime: K8s resources
